{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24110","headline":"隐几赠客 · 白居易","name":"隐几赠客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宦情本淡薄，年貌又老丑。\n紫绶与金章，於予亦何有。\n有时独隐几，荅然无所偶。\n卧枕一卷书，起尝一杯酒。\n书将引昏睡，酒用扶衰朽。\n客到忽已酣，脱巾坐搔首。\n疎顽倚老病，容恕惭交友。\n忽思庄生言，亦拟鞭其後。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}